{
  "key": 22895,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_RoarkIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome!\n",
        "This is the Oreburgh Pokémon Gym!\r",
        "I’m Roark, the Gym Leader!\r",
        "I’m but one Trainer who decided to\n",
        "walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon!\r",
        "As the Gym Leader, I need to see\n",
        "your potential as a Trainer.\r",
        "And, I’ll need to see the toughness\n",
        "of the Pokémon that battle with you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_BeatRoark",
      "en_US": [
        "This is embarrassing...\r",
        "I went and lost to a Trainer who\n",
        "didn’t have a single Gym Badge...\r",
        "But that’s tough. You were strong,\n",
        "and I was weak. That’s all there is.\r",
        "According to Pokémon League rules,\n",
        "I have to give you our Gym Badge\f",
        "since you’ve beaten me, the Leader.\r",
        "Here’s your official Pokémon League\n",
        "Coal Badge.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_RoarkReceiveCoalBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Coal Badge from Roark!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_RoarkExplainCoalBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "That Coal Badge is proof you beat\n",
        "me fair and square.\r",
        "Take good care of it.\r",
        "You should also take this, too.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_RoarkExplainStealthRock",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contains\n",
        "the move Stealth Rock.\r",
        "It’s a move that inflicts damage on\n",
        "foes that switch into battle.\r",
        "Incidentally, a TM will teach its move\n",
        "to a Pokémon instantly.\r",
        "But a TM will break when you use it,\n",
        "so make certain you want a Pokémon\f",
        "to learn that move."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_RoarkGymBeaten",
      "en_US": [
        "In this region of Sinnoh, there are\n",
        "seven other Gym Leaders.\r",
        "I should warn you--they’re a lot\n",
        "tougher than I am!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_GymGuideBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy!\n",
        "How’s it going, Champ-to-be?\r",
        "That’s what I said to a really\n",
        "impatient boy earlier, too.\r",
        "Roark's rigged this Gym like a real\n",
        "quarry. Rock chutes everywhere!\r",
        "Get a Machop to heave on a winch,\n",
        "and the rubble slides away...\r",
        "...and piles up somewhere else!\n",
        "So watch where it lands.\r",
        "The Gym Leader is a user of\n",
        "Rock-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Well, listen. Rock-type Pokémon\n",
        "really hate water, all right?\r",
        "They’re also weak to Grass-type\n",
        "moves.\r",
        "Gee, they sure have weaknesses!\r",
        "But don’t think it will be easy.\r",
        "You don’t get to be a Gym Leader\n",
        "without covering for weaknesses.\r",
        "Going after a Rock-type Pokémon\n",
        "with a Fire-type Pokémon won’t be\f",
        "easy, either.\r",
        "That’s all the advice I can give.\n",
        "Thanks for listening!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_GymGuideAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You’ve taken care of the Gym Leader!\r",
        "So, did my advice come in handy\n",
        "or what?\r",
        "If my advice was useful, it’d be\n",
        "great if you’d become my fan!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_GymStatueBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oreburgh City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Roark\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_GymStatueAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oreburgh City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Roark\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_WinchPrompt",
      "en_US": [
        "A Machop is gripping a winch rope.\n",
        "The rope runs up to a rock chute.\r",
        "Have Machop heave on the winch?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_SlideLowerToEast",
      "en_US": [
        "Rocks rumbled down the chute!\r",
        "The lower stairs are clear now...\n",
        "but the east path is blocked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_SlideEastToLower",
      "en_US": [
        "Rocks rumbled down the chute!\r",
        "The east path is clear now...\n",
        "but the lower stairs are blocked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_SlideUpperToLower",
      "en_US": [
        "Rocks rumbled down the chute!\r",
        "The upper stairs are clear now...\n",
        "but the lower stairs are blocked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_SlideLowerToUpper",
      "en_US": [
        "Rocks rumbled down the chute!\r",
        "The lower stairs are clear now...\n",
        "but the upper stairs are blocked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_WinchJammed",
      "en_US": [
        "Machop heaved with all its might,\n",
        "but the rubble won't budge.\r",
        "Something must be piled up in\n",
        "the way below."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_WinchIdle",
      "en_US": [
        "Machop: Maaachop!\r",
        "It's flexing proudly next to an\n",
        "empty rock chute."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_Rubble",
      "en_US": [
        "A heap of fallen rock blocks\n",
        "the way. It won't budge by hand."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghGym_Text_LooseRock",
      "en_US": [
        "Loose rock from the quarry walls."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
